WEBVTT

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:08.303
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.325 --> 00:00:10.820
<v><b>A:</b></v> Can you speak German?

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.411
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I can.

00:00:14.404 --> 00:00:15.082
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.093 --> 00:00:17.869
<v><b>M:</b></v> I can’t find the keys.

00:00:19.898 --> 00:00:20.606
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:22.874
<v><b>F:</b></v> She can sing.

00:00:24.907 --> 00:00:25.698
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:28.763
<v><b>M:</b></v> Where can I buy a newspaper?

00:00:30.736 --> 00:00:31.556
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:33.760
<v><b>A:</b></v> Can you cook?

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.638
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I can’t.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:38.501
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:39.481 --> 00:00:41.221
<v><b>F:</b></v> He can’t swim.